  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はじめ",
    "text": "「あ、あれ？　転校生くん？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はじめ",
    "text": "「ここ、は？　弓道場？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はじめ",
    "text": "「何でわたし、こんなところで寝てたんだろ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 8,
    "dress": "old-bunny",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-bunny_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 18,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はじめ",
    "text": "「だめだな。決まった時間になると強制的にスリープしちゃう癖、直さないと。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はじめ",
    "text": "「おとなになって車とか運転するようになったら、危ないもんね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 8,
    "dress": "old-bunny",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-bunny_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 18,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はじめ",
    "text": "「ありがとう、起こしてくれて。転校生くんは、良い子だね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 8,
    "dress": "old-bunny",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-bunny_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 18,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はじめ",
    "text": "「あぁ、ぼんやり思いだしてきた……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はじめ",
    "text": "「湖南さんに眼鏡を貸してあげようと思って、弓道場まで取りにきたんだ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はじめ",
    "text": "「眼鏡を探してるうちに時間切れになって、強制的にスリープしちゃった……のかな？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 8,
    "dress": "old-bunny",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-bunny_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 18,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はじめ",
    "text": "「いけない。湖南さん、待たせたままだよ。転校生くん、そのへんに眼鏡がないかな？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 8,
    "dress": "old-bunny",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-bunny_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 18,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はじめ",
    "text": "「いっしょに、探してくれる？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 8,
    "dress": "old-bunny",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
